go 1.25.0

use (
	./packages/devhex
	./packages/platformkit/go/devenv
)

// Absorption (rationalization): PlatformKit was merged history-preserving via
// `git subtree` at packages/platformkit/ (squash of upstream e408165). It is the
// canonical Go SDK monorepo home for the devenv/devhex modules.
//
// Known overlaps (left in place for reversibility; resolve in a follow-up):
//   - packages/platformkit/go/devhex duplicates packages/devhex (same module path
//     github.com/KooshaPari/devenv-abstraction); only packages/devhex is `use`d.
//   - packages/platformkit/go/devenv is the older lowercase-path copy
//     (github.com/kooshapari/devenv-abstraction).
//
// PhenoMCP Go module decision: PhenoMCP RETAINS its own Go module (per
// RATIONALIZATION_PLAN). It is consumed by phenotype-go-sdk as a dependency, not
// vendored here. packages/mcpkit/go/go.work references not-yet-present
// pheno-mcp-* modules and is intentionally deferred (not part of this absorption).
